      "clause_number": "1",
      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 1489 (Part 1) : 2015) covers and specifies requirements for Portland Pozzolana Cement - Specification - Part 1: Fly Ash Based (Third Revision). It applies to portland_pozzolana_cement under cement category in the construction_civil domain.",
