      "clause_id": "CLAUSE-DOC019-6.1",
      "clause_number": "6.1",
      "title": "Compressive Strength",
      "content": "Compressive Strength: 28-day compressive strength shall not be less than 33 MPa. 7-day strength shall not be less than 22 MPa. 3-day strength shall not be less than 16 MPa.",
